.KEY ALLDIR/A,MACHINE/A
.BRA [
.KET ]
; The whole release check of one target from the payload in RAM:vc: smoke, OpenGL, and the
; package upgrade with apkg (copied to RAM:ctest). The upgrade starts the previous release's
; window, which must be closed by hand (its close gadget) for the script to go on.
; Execute RAM:vc/run-all <results directory> <machine name>. Its key is not RUNDIR: the scripts it
; runs set their own RUNDIR, which would replace it here.
FailAt 21
MakeDir [ALLDIR]/smoke [ALLDIR]/gpu [ALLDIR]/upgrade
Execute RAM:vc/run-smoke [ALLDIR]/smoke
Execute RAM:vc/run-gpu [ALLDIR]/gpu
MakeDir RAM:ctest
Copy RAM:vc/apkg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/vc.zip RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/vc-old.zip RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/idx.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/idx-old.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/steps-pkg.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/steps-pkg2.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/shapes.svg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/run-use RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/run-upgrade RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/run-pkg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Execute RAM:ctest/run-upgrade [ALLDIR]/upgrade [MACHINE]
Echo "all done" >[ALLDIR]/all-done.txt
